# Baked into the static build by `next build` (see lib/api.ts resolveApiBase).
# Public URL, not a secret — safe to commit. This exists because Cloudflare's
# dashboard cannot set build-time env vars on a static-assets-only Worker, so
# the value has to live here instead.
